rry potter ended gambon has been  featured in many shows films including  the pbs miniseries little women victoria  and abdul kingsman the golden circle  dan's army and judy  13. phillies flitwick warwick davis  warwick davis plays professor filius  flitwick in the harry potter films also  less notably griphook flipwick's  character was known for many things his  mastery of dueling his teaching of  charms and perhaps most notably being  the head of ravenclaw house  since harry potter ended davis has  featured in a number of films tv shows  including doctor who and various  projects inside of the star wars  franchise  14. aberforth dumbledore aberforth  dumbledore the brother of hogwarts  headmaster albus dumbledore was played  by actor kieran hinz  since harry foster ended hinz has  featured a number of films tv shows  including rome game of thrones and  shetland  15. weasley twins the mischievous  weasley twins fred and george weasley  were played respectively by actors james  and oliver phelps  since harry potter ended the actors have  continued to work together starring in  various television acting roles  however it appears that the pair have  also branched out from traditional media  by starting their own podcast normal not  normal  16. fleur de la cour clemens posey  fleur de la cour fierce tri-wizard  tournament contestant and later wife to  bill weasley was played by actress  clemence posey  since harry potter ended posey has  continued to thrive in her successful  modelling career while simultaneously  landing roles in big name films such as  tenet  17. james finnegan devin murray james  finnegan the young gryffindor who had a  knack for blowing things up was played  by irish actor devin murray since harry  potter ended murray appears to have  weaned off of film television and  instead seems to be focusing on his  family life  in 2018 murray began dating shannon  quinn and in 2021 they welcomed their  son cooper 18. draco malfoy tom felton  draco malfoy har