r was expertly played by  actor daniel radcliffe  provided that daniel's role is  synonymous with the films you'd think  that he would have been typecast as  harry forever  and if you thought that you're probably  still right  however radcliffe a truly dedicated  actor clearly has ambitions of  transcending being just harry potter as  he has starred featured in many films  since the harry potter films came to an  end  since harry potter ended radcliffe has  tried his hand at broadway  starring in the broadway musical how to  succeed in business without really  trying as well as featured in numerous  films including but not limited to the  woman in black now you see me too and  the lost city  but in what i feel will be his best  performance yet aside from harry of  course radcliffe will be starring in the  upcoming weird al yankovic biopic  playing weird al himself  28. argus filch david bradley  argus filch hogwarts resident caretaker  and second half to mrs norris was played  by actor david bradley since harry  potter ended bradley has been extremely  active in the film tv industry which is  particularly impressive if we consider  the fact that he's now 80 years old he's  been involved in a multitude of  successful tv series since harry potter  ended including afterlife game of  thrones doctor who and wizards at 80 he  doesn't seem to be slowing down either  may bradley be an inspiration to us all  29. arthur weasley mark williams  arthur weasley kind patient and caring  father of the impressively large weasley  family was played by actor mark williams  since harry potter ended williams has  found a considerable amount of success  in the long-running bbc tv series father  brown where he plays the main character  the series is currently nine seasons  strong and looks as though it may be  back for more  30. molly weasley julie walters molly  weasley mother of the weasley clan and  destroyer of bellatrix estranged was  played by actress julie walters  after harry pott